# Tauri updater signing keys — private key lives in ~/.tauri/ (outside
# the repo) and in GH Actions secrets, never here. These patterns are
# belt-and-suspenders: if a key file ever gets copied into the repo by
# accident, git refuses to stage it.
*.key
*.key.pub
.tauri/

